# Daily app map report — Graphify + Floorplan

Runbook: `docs/APP_MAP_DAILY_ROUTINE.md` · ZTE-015

## AM (≈ 09:00 SAST)

- [ ] `git pull` · `npm run factory:status`
- [ ] Floorplan: update if merges yesterday
- [ ] Graphify: refresh if large refactor
- [ ] `npm run planning:daily-report -- --slot am`
- [ ] Fill `DAILY_SUMMARY.md` in archive · paste to Notion AM brief

## PM (≈ 17:00 SAST)

- [ ] Floorplan Recent work vs factory queue ZTE-*
- [ ] `npm run planning:daily-report -- --slot pm`
- [ ] `agent-work-archive.sh` → Stud-Bot-Depo
- [ ] Obsidian `brain/daily/YYYY-MM-DD-pm.md` done/blocked/tomorrow
- [ ] Notion consolidated (5 lines)

## Agent memory (weekly)

- [ ] Refresh `brain/apps/portable-agents.md` from GRAPH_REPORT + floorplan parts
- [ ] Notion Memory: facts only, no keys